	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;SE 3130 Alouette II&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#000000;\">(mainly used between Le Bourget and Orly)</span></span></span></li>
</ul>

<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<strong><span style=\"font-size: medium\">2.2 </span></strong><span style=\"font-size: medium\">-&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">Only flight hours performed on aircraft types corresponding to the member’s rank and justified by submission of a PIREP, either manually or via ACARS, will be accepted (flight reports sent through FsPassengers are not counted). Members may fly other aircraft types not belonging to their rank, but in that case, the flight hours will not be accepted, except for flights performed for the subsidiaries \"Inter Cargo Service\" and \"Air Charter International.\"<br />
<span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;<br />
<strong>2.3 </strong>-&nbsp;</span>Aircraft changes are only allowed at the company hub (Paris-Orly West, LFPO), except for the Alouette II, which has a special status (see §2.5 below). Any pilot wishing to change aircraft must return to the hub for the change.</span></span><br />
<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium\">&nbsp;<br />
<strong>2.4</strong> -&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Reserved</span><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium\"><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<strong>2.5</strong> - <span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">Given the low cruising speed and limited range of the Alouette II, the operation of this aircraft is not restricted by the Orly hub rule and may be conducted from the following airports for scheduled flights:</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><br />
&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>

<ul>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">&nbsp;Paris-Orly (LFPO)</span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;Paris-Le Bourget (LFPB)</span></span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;Caen-Carpiquet (LFRK)</span></span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;Nice-Côte d\'Azur (LFMN)</span></span></span></li>
</ul>

<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;</span><br />
And from the following airports/helipads for ancillary activities :<br />
<span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>

<ul>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">&nbsp;Paris-Orly (LFPO)</span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;Paris-Le Bourget (LFPB)</span></span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;Lognes-Emerainville (LFPL)</span></span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;Caen-Carpiquet (LFRK)</span></span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;Le Havre-Octeville (LFOH)</span></span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;Nice-Côte d\'Azur (LFMN)</span></span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;Héliport de Monaco (LNMC)</span></span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;Hélistation de Grimaud (HGRI)</span></span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;Chambery-Aix les Bains (LFLB)</span></span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;Altiport de Courchevel (LFLJ)</span></span></span></li>
</ul>

<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;</span><br />
Any pilot wishing to change aircraft must return to one of the airports/helipads listed above to return the Alouette II, and then must again comply with the Orly Hub rule (see §2.3 above).</span></span><br />
<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>

<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium\">3-THE SUBSIDIARY</span></strong></span></span><br />
&nbsp;</h2>

<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium\"><strong>&nbsp;3.0</strong> -<strong> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">Inter Cargo Service :</span></span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><br />
&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />
<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">Inter Cargo Service was the direct subsidiary of Air Inter created in 1987 to meet the growing demand for air cargo transport. Inter Cargo transported passengers during the day and cargo at night. The company was renamed \"Inter Ciel Service\" in 1990 and then \"Aéropostale\" in 1991. The aircraft used by the subsidiary are:<br />
<span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>

<ul>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">Lockheed L-100-30(382G) Hercules all cargo F-GFZE.</span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Vickers Vanguard 953C all cargo F-GEJE / F-GEJF.</span></span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Boeing 737-2Q5C Convertible passager/cargo F-GFVR.</span></span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Boeing 737-230QC Quick Change passager/cargo F-GFVJ / F-GFVI.</span></span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Boeing 737-242C Convertible passager/cargo F-GFVK.</span></span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Boeing 737-2K2C(A) Convertible passager/cargo F-GGZA / F-GGVP / F-GGVQ.</span></span></span></li>
</ul>

<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;</span><br />
All flights may be carried out with the aircraft of choice to any destination while respecting the aircraft change rule at Paris-Orly. Flight hours and PIREPs count toward the VA career. Call sign <strong>ICFxxx</strong> or <strong>ICFxxxx</strong> (3 digits for domestic flights and 4 digits for international flights). Flight plan REMARK section: <strong>OPR/AIR INTER FLIGHT OPR BY INTER CARGO SERVICE</strong></span></span><br />
&nbsp;</p>

<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium\">4-THE DIVISION</span></strong></span></span><br />
&nbsp;</h2>

<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium\"><strong>4.0 - </strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><strong>Air Charter International :</strong><br />
&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">Air Charter International was a subdivision of Air France and Air Inter created in 1966 under the name SAFA-Société Aérienne Française d\'Affrètement, renamed Air Charter International in 1970. Flights operated by Air Charter International are on behalf of Air France, Air Inter, Euralair, and Europe Aero Service. Following the merger of Air France and Air Inter, the company ceased operations in 1998. The aircraft used by this division are:<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<strong>a) Preferred:</strong><br />
&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>

<ul>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">Sud-Aviation SE-210 Caravelle III F-BJTE.</span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Sud-Aviation SE-210 Caravelle 10B3</span></span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Boeing 727-214 ADV</span></span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Boeing 737-222</span></span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Boeing 737-400</span></span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Boeing 737-500</span></span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Boeing 747-200</span></span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Airbus A300-B4-203</span></span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Airbus A310-324</span></span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Airbus A320-212</span></span></span></li>
</ul>

<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><br />
Leased aircraft :</span></span></span></p>

<ul>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">Lockheed L-1049G Super Constellation (<span style=\"color:#000000;\">leased from</span>&nbsp;Air France)</span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Fokker F28-4000 (</span><span style=\"color:#000000;\">leased from</span><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;Touraine Air Transport TAT)</span></span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Dassault Mercure 100 (leased from Air Inter)</span></span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Boeing 747-200 (leased from Air France)</span></span></span></li>
</ul>

<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><br />
<strong>b) Optional :</strong><br />
&nbsp;</span><br />
Any other aircraft at the members’ discretion, e.g.:<br />
<span style=\"color:#000000;\"></span></span></span></p>

<ul>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">Boeing 767-300ER Level-D.</span></span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Boeing 747-400 PMDG.</span></span></span></li>
